{"ts":"2026-07-29T22:24:17.487Z","author":"codex","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"f1d20826ab53f6f53d2a220a","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-graph-b3sw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm-graph status help documents the version field with a stale literal, and the release version-bump regex targets that string instead of the real declaration"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The status command's help output map describes every field except version, which carries the literal 2026.7.28 rather than a description. The release workflow's first version regex is unanchored and non-global, so in this package its only match is that nested help string; the authoritative declarations are manifest.json and the EXTENSION_VERSION constant. Fixing the help text alone would be silently undone on the next release, so the regex must be anchored to the manifest property level in the same change."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:help-output","area:release-automation"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-29T22:24:17.487Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T22:24:17.487Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The status help output documents version as a field description, not as a version literal; The release version-bump regex cannot match a nested string, so the help text survives a release; A test fails if the status help version entry ever becomes version-like again"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"0886ccddfcc4d2a27dcdc11721b60a37b7d7302ea3b15cbe59ae52bd628cfef7","message":""}
